out yourself that cannot be found elsewhere in your application (may address extenuating circumstances).", "limit": "500 words", "required": false}, {"prompt": "Discuss why you are applying to the Lauder Institute, detailing specific reasons, experiences, and background (also asks about Program of Concentration and, for language applicants, what you hope to gain and how you learned the language; and how you would benefit from and contribute to the Lauder community).", "limit": "500 words", "required": true}, {"prompt": "Imagine you''re in a classroom and a fellow student makes a statement you find offensive or problematic. (Describe how you would respond, guiding principles, and hoped-for outcome.)", "limit": "200 words", "required": true}], "source_url": "https://lauder.wharton.upenn.edu/how-to-apply/mbama-applicants/"}, "video_assessment": {"value": "Page does not mention a video requirement.", "source_url": "https://mba.wharton.upenn.edu/mba-application-requirements/"}, "interview": {"value": "Invitation-only. All accepted MBA/MA students must have both a Lauder interview and a Wharton interview (plus Team-Based Discussion per Wharton requirements page).", "source_url": "https://lauder.wharton.upenn.edu/how-to-apply/mbama-applicants/"}, "recommendations": {"value": "One letter, preferably from a current or former supervisor, using GMAC Common Letter of Recommendation. Carey JD/MBA applicants submit two letters.", "source_url": "https://mba.wharton.upenn.edu/mba-application-requirements/"}, "other_requirements": {"value": "Lauder Supplement embedded in Wharton MBA application (proposed Program of Concentration, target language, current OPI rating). One joint application; can only apply to one joint degree at Wharton.", "source_url": "https://lauder.wharton.upenn.edu/how-to-apply/mbama-applicants/"}, "notes": "Lauder Indonesian/Bahasa availability under the East and Southeast Asia concentration was not verified on pages read. Lauder essay prompts paraphrased in part where the page truncated."}'::jsonb,null,null),
