oment in your career, and why now is the right time to take this next step. Part II: what do you hope to contribute to the students who will learn alongside you? (page paraphrase; exact full wording not captured)", "limit": "550 words", "required": true}, {"prompt": "Re-applicant: how you have grown or changed personally and professionally since you previously applied.", "limit": "250 words", "required": false}], "source_url": "https://www.kellogg.northwestern.edu/admissions/ft-admissions/ft-how-to-apply/"}, "video_assessment": {"value": "Five video questions after submission: brief think time, up to 1 minute each, about 30 min; official answers cannot be redone.", "source_url": "https://www.kellogg.northwestern.edu/admissions/ft-admissions/ft-how-to-apply/"}, "interview": {"value": "Invitation only, rolling; all interviews virtual.", "source_url": "https://www.kellogg.northwestern.edu/admissions/ft-admissions/ft-how-to-apply/"}, "recommendations": {"value": "Two letters: one ideally current supervisor, one who can assess performance and leadership potential. Three recommender prompts (300, 300, 250 words).", "source_url": "https://www.kellogg.northwestern.edu/admissions/ft-admissions/ft-how-to-apply/"}, "other_requirements": {"value": "Resume/CV; transcripts from all institutions (non-English: original plus authorized verbatim English translation; official copies only at matriculation); bachelor''s or equivalent by matriculation; at least two years full-time work strongly recommended.", "source_url": "https://www.kellogg.northwestern.edu/admissions/ft-admissions/ft-how-to-apply/"}, "notes": "Kellogg full-time MBA programs are STEM-designated. International applicants are encouraged to apply in Round 1 or 2 for visa timing; name must match passport for I-20. Applicants may apply to only one full-time program per year. Credential evaluation for FT MBA not stated; international bachelor''s equivalent to four-year US degree required (some three-year degrees may be acceptable)."}'::jsonb,'{"class_label": "MBA Class of 2027 (entered fall 2025); Class of 2028 page exists but stat values did not load", "gmat_avg": 733, "gmat_median": null, "gmat_range": "Averages only: GMAT Classic avg 733; GMAT Focus avg 687 (no ranges reported)", "gmat_focus_median": null, "gmat_focus_range": null, "gre_verbal_avg": 162, "gre_quant_avg": 162, "gre_range": null, "gpa_avg": 3.68, "gpa_range": null, "work_exp_avg_years": 5.1, "work_exp_range": null, "class_size": 534, "international_pct": 37, "women_pct": null, "countries": null, "pct_submitted_gre": null, "source_url": "https://www.clearadmit.com/2025/11/northwestern-kellogg-mba-class-of-2027-profile/", "source_name": "Clear Admit summary of Kellogg Class of 2027 profile; note: Clear Admit also gave GMAT Focus average 687 (stored in gmat_range field)"}'::jsonb,'{"report_label": "Class of 2025", "employed_3_months_pct": null, "median_base_salary": "USD 175,000", "mean_base_salary": null, "top_industries": "Consulting 38%, Financial services 21%, Technology 19%", "top_employers": "McKinsey, Bain, BCG, PwC Strategy&, Deloitte, Accenture Strategy; J.P. Morgan, KKR, Warburg Pincus, Evercore, AQR; Apple, Amazon, Google, Microsoft, Snowflake", "international_employed_note": "90% accepted within 6 months (no 3-month figure on page); median total comp USD 205,000. No international info found.", "source_url": "https://www.kellogg.northwestern.edu/news/blog/2025/12/17/class-2025-career-outcomes-top-employers/", "source_name": "Kellogg news blog Class of 2025 career outcomes"}'::jsonb),
