ong 2. No salary or 3-month %.", "source_url": "https://academics.business.columbia.edu/sites/academics/files-efs/imce-uploads/MSFE/v3%20cmc-msfe-report-3_ada.pdf", "source_name": "CBS MSFE employment report PDF (2026 page https://business.columbia.edu/msfe-employment-report has charts only)"}'::jsonb),
