rolling. About 30 minutes, behavioral, with Yale SOM staff; no technical finance questions.", "source_url": "https://som.yale.edu/programs/mms-asset-management/admissions/application-guide"}, "recommendations": {"value": "Two letters: one academic and one professional/applied, in English, written entirely by the recommenders.", "source_url": "https://som.yale.edu/programs/mms-asset-management/admissions/application-guide"}, "other_requirements": {"value": "One-page resume; unofficial transcripts from all institutions (official on enrollment); each role entered in Work Experience; up to 2 undergraduate and 2 postgraduate activities. Quantitative coursework recommended, not required.", "source_url": "https://som.yale.edu/programs/mms-asset-management/admissions/application-information"}, "notes": "Application fee amount not stated on pages read. Designed for early-career applicants; an optional MBA joint degree exists."}'::jsonb,'{"class_label": "Class of 2027", "gmat_avg": null, "gmat_median": null, "gmat_range": "GMAT Focus middle 80%: 659-711 (24% submitted GMAT); older-edition GMAT median 745 (13% of GMAT takers)", "gmat_focus_median": null, "gmat_focus_range": "middle 80%: 659-711", "gre_verbal_avg": null, "gre_quant_avg": null, "gre_range": "Page text is garbled: lists ''GRE 166-170 (middle 80%)'' and ''Quant 158-168''; verify on page before use", "gpa_avg": null, "gpa_range": "middle 80%: 3.66-3.98 (US schools, 4.0 scale)", "work_exp_avg_years": null, "work_exp_range": "0 years 63%; under 1 year 6%; 1-2 years 5%; more than 2 years 25%", "class_size": 63, "international_pct": 67, "women_pct": 44, "countries": 20, "pct_submitted_gre": 76, "source_url": "https://som.yale.edu/programs/mms-asset-management/student-experience/class-profile-class-2027", "source_name": "Yale SOM MMS Asset Management class profile (international = foreign nationals; 76% GRE figure attached to a garbled GRE line)"}'::jsonb,'{"report_label": "Class of 2025 employment report; 95.6% had acc