ent) at a top business school. Transcripts (unofficial to apply, official to enroll; offers conditional). One-page resume recommended. 1+1 route: apply via Year 1 school.", "source_url": "https://som.yale.edu/programs/mms-global-business-and-society/admissions/application-information"}, "notes": "For MiM students and graduates only. Three essays of 300 words or fewer each; prompts not listed. Non-English transcripts need translation. English tests not stated on the page. Visa required; USD 3,000 non-refundable deposit. M2M Pathways (HEC Paris, HKUST, UBC Sauder) feeds this program."}'::jsonb,null,'{"report_label": "Class of 2025 employment report; 100% received a job offer by 6 months (not 3 months), 81.7% survey response", "employed_3_months_pct": null, "median_base_salary": null, "mean_base_salary": null, "top_industries": "Finance, consulting, technology, consumer goods, social sector named; no percentages readable", "top_employers": "Cumulative list (not Class of 2025 only) includes Accenture, Amazon, Google, McKinsey, Goldman Sachs, JPMorgan Chase, Tesla, Tencent, ByteDance, Morgan Stanley", "international_employed_note": "US 37.0% of hires (Northeast 28.3%), Asia 30.4%, Europe 30.4%, MENA 2.2%. No salary data.", "source_url": "https://som.yale.edu/programs/mms-global-business-and-society/careers/employment-report-2025", "source_name": "Yale SOM MMS GBS employment report Class of 2025"}'::jsonb),
