ements on the live application. WES US-version Course-by-Course evaluation required for non-US degrees (allow 4-8 weeks). Certified literal English translations; notarized copies not accepted."}'::jsonb,null,'{"report_label": "Class of 2025 Ross one-year master''s career results", "employed_3_months_pct": null, "median_base_salary": null, "mean_base_salary": "About USD 87,500 average starting salary (type of pay not specified)", "top_industries": "Technology, consulting, healthcare", "top_employers": "Amazon, Microsoft, Deloitte, United Airlines", "international_employed_note": "No placement percentage or international data given.", "source_url": "https://michiganross.umich.edu/graduate/one-year-masters/admissions-blog/2026/04/24/career-results-ross-oym-graduates-strong", "source_name": "Ross one-year master''s admissions blog, April 2026"}'::jsonb),
