uture-leaders-admission/"}, "other_requirements": {"value": "For early-career applicants: final-year bachelor''s student, or master''s entered directly after bachelor''s completing by Jun 1, 2027, or 2026 bachelor''s graduate with no more than 6 months full-time experience. Resume max 2 pages. Transcripts from all universities.", "source_url": "https://tech.cornell.edu/admissions/future-leaders-admission/"}, "notes": "Non-US/Canada transcripts need course-by-course credential evaluation (WES, ECE, etc.) before decision. Separate application, not transferable."}'::jsonb,null,null),
