red": true}], "source_url": "https://www.insead.edu/master-programmes/master-finance/admissions"}, "video_assessment": {"value": "Kira Talent within 48 hours of deadline: 4 video questions (45s prep, 60s answer) plus 1 written question (5 minutes); about 15-20 minutes.", "source_url": "https://www.insead.edu/master-programmes/master-finance/admissions"}, "interview": {"value": "Pre-selected candidates interview with an INSEAD alum, typically in country of residence; process up to 8 weeks.", "source_url": "https://www.insead.edu/master-programmes/master-finance/admissions"}, "recommendations": {"value": "2 required by deadline: one professional (current/former manager) and one academic; optional third.", "source_url": "https://www.insead.edu/master-programmes/master-finance/admissions"}, "other_requirements": {"value": "CV (free format or INSEAD template); scanned transcripts and diploma, official if admitted. Target applicants 0-2 years experience; applications opened 17 July 2026.", "source_url": "https://www.insead.edu/master-programmes/master-finance"}, "notes": "Page''s essay 5 text says ''MIM'' (likely template wording on the MIF page). Language policy PDF for MIF with minimum scores and second-language rule not fetched. Non-European applicants: apply early for French student visa."}'::jsonb,null,null),
