es and what steps are you taking to achieve them? (also asks about alternatives considered and the geographic region you hope to work in)", "limit": "500 words", "required": true}, {"prompt": "Which areas of LBS life are you most excited to join and where would you add value to the community? (paraphrased from page)", "limit": "300 words", "required": true}], "source_url": "https://www.london.edu/masters-degrees/masters-in-finance-full-time/apply"}, "video_assessment": null, "interview": {"value": "Selected applicants interviewed by MiF alumni or senior admissions staff in their region; may need to travel. No offer without interview.", "source_url": "https://www.london.edu/masters-degrees/masters-in-finance-full-time/apply"}, "recommendations": {"value": "1 referee nominated in application; reference must reach LBS by deadline", "source_url": "https://www.london.edu/masters-degrees/masters-in-finance-full-time/apply"}, "other_requirements": {"value": "Online form; one-page CV (gaps explained on separate sheet); transcripts from every university with translation. No explicit minimum criteria.", "source_url": "https://www.london.edu/masters-degrees/masters-in-finance-full-time/apply"}, "notes": "Q2 prompt is paraphrased from the page extraction. No video listed. Calendar dates not captured."}'::jsonb,'{"class_label": "MiFFT2024", "gmat_avg": null, "gmat_median": null, "gmat_range": null, "gmat_focus_median": null, "gmat_focus_range": null, "gre_verbal_avg": null, "gre_quant_avg": null, "gre_range": null, "gpa_avg": null, "gpa_range": null, "work_exp_avg_years": 5.7, "work_exp_range": null, "class_size": 132, "international_pct": 95, "women_pct": null, "countries": 46, "pct_submitted_gre": null, "source_url": "https://assets.london.edu/hxo16fanegqh/c7089a37-a80b-4175-b344-1914ad1ea176/02a89ef492167de3d23e65b5ec8b3c56/mif_employment_report.pdf", "source_name": "LBS MiF Employment Report (class of 2024; GMAT not reported; garbled PDF extraction)"}'::jsonb,'{"report_label": "MiFFT2024 employment report (100% reporting; may not be latest)", "employed_3_months_pct": 80, "median_base_salary": null, "mean_base_salary": "GBP 66,814 (approx 70% shared data)", "top_industries": "Financial services 81% (Banking 30%, Investment Mgmt 25%, PE 16%), non-finance 19%", "top_employers": "Goldman Sachs, Morgan Stanley, Citi, Bank of America, McKinsey, Moelis, IFC (alphabetical, 62 firms)", "international_employed_note": "80% accepted, 82% received offer within 3 months. 95% international, 46 nationalities; 47% stayed in UK.", "source_url": "https://assets.london.edu/hxo16fanegqh/c7089a37-a80b-4175-b344-1914ad1ea176/02a89ef492167de3d23e65b5ec8b3c56/mif_employment_report.pdf", "source_name": "LBS MiF Employment Report"}'::jsonb),
