minute online Zoom interview in English with Program Director(s) and alumni.", "source_url": "https://www.hec.edu/en/master-s-programs/master-management/admissions"}, "recommendations": {"value": "One confidential academic reference via portal; request at least 4 weeks before deadline.", "source_url": "https://www.hec.edu/en/master-s-programs/master-management/admissions"}, "other_requirements": {"value": "At least a three-year bachelor''s in any field (final-year students must prove completion); little to no professional experience; Degree certificate(s) or enrollment certificate; official transcripts incl. exchange programs (current master''s students also bachelor''s); one-page CV; passport-style photo; all documents by round deadline. Direct application fee EUR 180.", "source_url": "https://www.hec.edu/en/master-s-programs/master-management/admissions"}, "notes": "Essay questions are program-specific and only visible in the application portal after selecting the program; not published on the page. Non-French bachelor''s holders may alternatively apply through Join a School in France (fee EUR 250; deadlines 2 Oct 2026, 7 Jan, 26 Feb, 19 Apr 2027; target intake September 2027). Only one application route allowed."}'::jsonb,'{"class_label": "Not stated", "gmat_avg": null, "gmat_median": null, "gmat_range": null, "gmat_focus_median": null, "gmat_focus_range": null, "gre_verbal_avg": null, "gre_quant_avg": null, "gre_range": null, "gpa_avg": null, "gpa_range": null, "work_exp_avg_years": null, "work_exp_range": null, "class_size": null, "international_pct": null, "women_pct": null, "countries": 52, "pct_submitted_gre": null, "source_url": "https://www.hec.edu/en/masters-programs/master-management", "source_name": "HEC Paris MiM page (40% internationally based, 2024 graduation survey; no size/GMAT)"}'::jsonb,'{"report_label": "FT ranking 2025/2026 figures", "employed_3_months_pct": 99, "median_base_salary": null, "mean_base_salary": "EUR 118.5K average 3 years after g