 invited to a video interview with Programme Director or faculty; assesses suitability, not English.", "source_url": "https://www.jbs.cam.ac.uk/masters-degrees/mst-social-innovation/apply/"}, "recommendations": {"value": "2 referees (academic or professional); at least one academic if 5 years or less since last course.", "source_url": "https://www.jbs.cam.ac.uk/masters-degrees/mst-social-innovation/apply/"}, "other_requirements": {"value": "UK 2:1 or equivalent or postgraduate qualification; at least 2 years full-time work in NGO, public body or private sector; CV; transcripts; list preferred Colleges.", "source_url": "https://www.jbs.cam.ac.uk/masters-degrees/mst-social-innovation/apply/"}, "notes": "No visa sponsorship; visitor entry supported for residentials, applicant responsible for immigration permission. Exact prompts for statements not published; only topics."}'::jsonb,null,null),
