counting, finance, HR, marketing, operations, strategy, supply chain); CV; transcripts; no work experience needed (under 1 year since graduating); no research proposal or statement required.", "source_url": "https://www.jbs.cam.ac.uk/masters-degrees/mphil-management/apply/"}, "notes": "Intended as a stepping stone for recent non-business graduates; most Indonesian MBA applicants with work experience will not qualify (must be within 1 year of undergraduate graduation)."}'::jsonb,null,null),
