nimum stated on page)", "source_url": "https://www.ceibs.edu/mba/application"}, "notes": "FAQ says at least 2 compulsory essays and 1 optional essay; exact prompts not published on fetched pages. English test minimum not stated by CEIBS MBA pages. Tuition RMB 488,000 (16-month). Deferral limited to one."}'::jsonb,'{"class_label": "Class of 2028 (2026 intake)", "gmat_avg": null, "gmat_median": null, "gmat_range": null, "gmat_focus_median": null, "gmat_focus_range": null, "gre_verbal_avg": null, "gre_quant_avg": null, "gre_range": null, "gpa_avg": null, "gpa_range": null, "work_exp_avg_years": 6.0, "work_exp_range": null, "class_size": null, "international_pct": 50.5, "women_pct": 44.2, "countries": 29, "pct_submitted_gre": null, "source_url": "https://ceibs.edu/mba/class-profile", "source_name": "CEIBS MBA class profile (international = ''overseas students''). GMAT not on this page; the MBA2025 Career Report PDF shows mid-80% GMAT ranges 640-740 and 620-720 for two cohorts, but column labels were unclear in extraction so not assigned."}'::jsonb,'{"report_label": "CEIBS MBA2025 Career Report (within 3 months of graduation)", "employed_3_months_pct": 90.0, "median_base_salary": "RMB 420,000 (annual base, range 180,000-870,000, n=61)", "mean_base_salary": null, "top_industries": "Technology 31.9%, Manufacturing 20.8%, Healthcare 15.3%, Consulting 9.7%, Financial services 9.7%, Education 5.6% (mapping from PDF text, moderately uncertain)", "top_employers": "Recruiting partners (not ranked by hires): Accenture, Amazon, Apple, ByteDance, Deloitte, L''Oreal, LVMH, McKinsey, Meituan, Roland Berger, Tencent, Xiaomi", "international_employed_note": "90.0% = 72 of 80 job seekers; 37 not seeking. 84.5% of jobs in Mainland China. No international-specific figure or visa info.", "source_url": "https://www.ceibs.edu/sites/portal.prod1.dpmgr.ceibs.edu/files/CEIBS-MBA2025-Career-Report.pdf", "source_name": "CEIBS MBA2025 Career Report"}'::jsonb),
